{{Main|Quests#Quest: Introduce Yourself}}
The player is given the {{Yellow|Quest: Introduce Yourself}}, where they have to speak to each of the {{Green|12}} '''Villagers''' scattered around the {{zone|Village}} and its surroundings.<br>After completing the quest, the player will be rewarded with {{c|50}}, as well as the {{c|120}} they got from talking to each '''Villager''' individually.-->

== Trivia ==
* Prior to 0.24.2, the '''Hub Villagers''' were [[NPC]]s that resided in the {{zone|Village}} as part of the {{Yellow|Introduce Yourself}} [[Quests|Quest]].

